OL,3,GNEWSARemembering woman who clung to
OL,4,ASpitfire in flight
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe incredible story of a woman who
OL,7,Fhung to the tail of a Spitfire in
OL,8,Fflight is being told by volunteers at
OL,9,Fan aviation centre.
OL,11,FMargaret Horton was a member of the
OL,12,Fground crew working on a Spitfire at
OL,13,FRAF Hibaldstow, in Lincolnshire, during
OL,14,Fthe Second World War when the pilot
OL,15,Ftook off without realising she was on
OL,16,Fthe tail. The pilot landed, Horton
OL,17,Fhopped off and went about her day.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
