OL,3,GNEWSARemembering woman who clung to
OL,4,ASpitfire in flight
OL,5,
OL,6,FHer story is being kept alive by North
OL,7,FLincolnshire Aviation Heritage Centre,
OL,8,Fwhich is marking seven years since work
OL,9,Fbegan on a visitor attraction at the
OL,10,Fformer RAF site.
OL,12,FPhil Jones, one of the centre's
OL,13,Fdirectors, said visitors enjoyed
OL,14,Fdiscovering such tales because "it's
OL,15,Fpart of who we are as human beings".
